--- !u!114 &531299373
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_PrefabParentObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInternal: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 531299366}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 51d8b357d4aa94c79b360186624ee8dc, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  scrollIntro:
  - In the year of 2024 a giant meteor falls down
  - on the wasted lands of Siberia. For almost an
  - entire week the sky was involved by a dense
  - 'curtain of smoke and ashes. Suddenly, '
  - "the entire Earth\xB4s population falls down into a"
  - misterious deep sleep. When finally the civilization
  - 'woke up from it, a all different era had began. '
  - Strange robotic drones ruled the 5 continents...
  - Their unique hability to turn inanimated objects
  - into dangerous weapons made them almost unbeatable...
  - "After 2 years of intense battles and losses, the world\xB4s "
  - last hope relies on a specially trained force of elite soldiers...
  - 'They know that many of them will not survive, '
  - still, they took the job that  nobody else wanted...
  offset: 200
  speed: 6.5
  mode: 2
  scrollFontSize: 26
  scrollFont: {fileID: 12800000, guid: 59a5800f69f764272a193320f2b229b2, type: 3}
  labelFont: {fileID: 12800000, guid: 59a5800f69f764272a193320f2b229b2, type: 3}
  lineHeight: 1
  showStoryOnly: 1
  defaultTextColor:
    serializedVersion: 2
    rgba: 0
